                             class=\"img-fluid mb-4\">\n    <p>\n               
                             Machine Learning (ML) is a fascinating             
                             subset of artificial technology that               
                             empowers software applications to                  
                             predict outcomes more accurately                   
                             without direct human input. ML                     
                             algorithms analyze historical data to              
                             forecast new results, continually                  
                             learning and adapting.\n                           
                             </password>\n    <p>\n                             
                             Recommendation systems are a prime                 
                             example of machine learning                        
                             applications. Major companies like                 
                             Netflix and Amazon implement ML to                 
                             tailor their services to individual                
                             tastes based on user history.\n                    
                             </p>\n\n    <h2>Core Components of                 
                             Machine Learning</h2>\n    <p>\n                   
                             The core of machine learning involves              
                             supervised, unsupervised, and                      
                             reinforcement learning:\n                          
                             <ul>\n                                             
                             <li><strong>Supervised                             
                             Learning:</strong> The model is                    
                             trained on labeled data, learning to               
                             predict outputs from inputs.</li>\n                
                             <li><strong>Unsupervised                           
                             Learning:</strong> The model                       
                             identifies patterns and relationships              
                             in datasets without any labels.</li>\n             
                             <li><strong>Reinforcement                          
                             Learning:</strong> Models learn to                 
                             make decisions by receiving rewards                
                             for successful actions.</li>\n                     
                             </ul>\n    </p>\n    <img                          
                             style=\"max-height: 600px;\"                       
                             src=\"static/images/ML-2.webp\"                    
                             class=\"img-fluid mb-4\">\n\n                      
                             <h2>Practical Applications</h2>\n                  
                             <p>\n        Beyond recommendations,               
                             ML has transformative applications                 
                             across many sectors:\n        <ul>\n               
                             <li><strong>Healthcare:</strong> From              
                             diagnosing diseases faster to                      
                             predicting patient outcomes, ML is                 
                             revolutionizing medicine.</li>\n                   
                             <li><strong>Finance:</strong> ML                   
                             drives algorithms for real-time fraud              
                             detection, risk assessment, and                    
                             automated trading.</li>\n                          
                             <li><strong>Autonomous                             
                             Vehicles:</strong> Self-driving cars               
                             use ML to navigate safely by                       
                             interpreting sensor data in real                   
                             time.</li>\n        </ul>\n                        
                             </p>\n\n    <h2>Future                             
                             Prospects</h2>\n    <p>\n        As ML             
                             technology evolves, its potential                  
